%% HAND-CURATED — sys-04 §6 BARGE_IN payload + plan §11 race-condition row.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant Orchestrator
    participant GoogleLiveFlash

    Note over Device,Orchestrator: orchestrator is streaming TTS_AUDIO to device — turn pipeline mid-flight
    Device->>Orchestrator: BARGE_IN (0x60) {sessionId, playback_position_ms, device_timestamp_ms}
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: increment barge_in_count for session
    alt barge_in_limit_exceeded
        Note over Orchestrator: barge_in_count > 5
        Orchestrator-->>Device: SESSION_CLOSE (0x70) end_reason=barge_limit
        Orchestrator-)Orchestrator: emit tbot-session-telemetry session.closed barge_limit
    else cancellation_race_token_already_streamed
        Note over Orchestrator: LLM_TOKEN frames after playback_position_ms already sent — discard, do not retract
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: cancel in-flight LLM/TTS calls
        Orchestrator-->>Device: BARGE_IN ack — TTS_DONE (0x41)
        Orchestrator-)Orchestrator: emit tbot-session-telemetry turn.cancelled
    else success
        Orchestrator->>GoogleLiveFlash: cancel in-flight LLM/TTS calls
        Orchestrator-->>Device: TTS_DONE (0x41) — flushes downlink buffer
        Orchestrator-)Orchestrator: emit tbot-session-telemetry turn.cancelled
    end

    Note over Device,Orchestrator: ack is TTS_DONE (no dedicated barge-in ack frame) — race: frames in flight past playback_position_ms must be discarded by device
